    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save data from the demo version cannot be transferred to the full version. Please take note.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo and full versions differ in terms of implemented features. \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Building Style \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Version: Play with a shared deck for all units. \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Version: Choose from two options - \u2460 Shared deck for all units or \u2461 Individual decks per unit. \u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspend Save and Load \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Version: \u2716 (Auto-save only) \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Version: \u3007 (Auto-save and 30 manual save slots) \u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage Retry \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Version: \u2716 \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Version: \u3007 \u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage Selection Screen \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Version: \u2716 (Only stages 1\u20134 available) \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Version: \u3007 (Freely access and revisit stages) \u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Version: Not Supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Version: Playable</p></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, other fine-tuning adjustments, specification changes, and bug fixes are only available in the full version.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike-style deckbuilding and SRPGs meet in this game to create an all-new genre!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the Clausewitz Battalion into a map shrouded in mist. Find and enhance cards to create powerful decks to do battle with against strong foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/8cffef7973a0539d65ce0e75eb56fbda.poster.avif?t=1747629834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/8cffef7973a0539d65ce0e75eb56fbda.webm?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/8cffef7973a0539d65ce0e75eb56fbda.mp4?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/ad5bbb04a13f4be0ab6cbe715dc501c1.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On that day, a jet black dragon descended on the kingdom, and in the blink of an eye it had destroyed everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 100 Years' War...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That was the name given to the ongoing battle between the 17 countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Already it seemed like a war with no end, but the appearance of a single dragon changed everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was a &quot;chimera&quot; created from a dragon with no interest in the humans' war and the spirit of a warmongering human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The weapon, created by the enemy country Fahftania, could not be completed without great sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Fahftania joined forces with the giant organization Hellmuth Brigade to sacrifice 1000 of their citizens to create the greatest chimera in history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having acquired this overwhelming power, no one possessed the ability to defeat Fahftania and the Hellmuth Brigade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seth Arden, a scout from the Clausewitz Battalion has discovered that Fahftania is creating chimeras in their aim to take over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearing this, Captain Vel Dina is angered by their inhumane experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To put a stop to these terrible, cold-hearted experiments, the Clausewitz Battalion sets off for Fahftania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, they would soon find that all of Fahftania is under the Hellmuth Brigade thrall... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/f74dd0367b31cbfa1421ee94ae0a9a65.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Fresh Gameplay: combining roguelike-style deckbuilding with SRPGs for a brand-new experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Cards: over 100 varieties, all with unique designs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Search Through the Mist: Clear away the mist on the map to discover enemies, facilities, and equipment and form a battle plan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Battle system: combines SRPG turn-based battles with card battles<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/923bf8ca85ea0607ced5b155882f419e.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the unique tactical gameplay offered by SRPGs with a rougelike twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use over 100 varieties of cards to build powerful decks, and strategically confront enemies on an SRPG field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter requires a different strategy. Adapt to new battlegrounds and plan accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the strongest deck and put a stop to the Hellmuth Brigade's actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss out on this new gaming experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/973881cbab504e689852928071532d7b.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It adds the elements of card battles to the traditional SRPG strategy-focused turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good deckbuilding is important to gain the upper edge in any battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fusion of the strategic positioning and tactics of SRPGs, with the excitement of card battlers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/81a86bdc5cc7928edac919aea8bcbeea.poster.avif?t=1747629834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/81a86bdc5cc7928edac919aea8bcbeea.webm?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/81a86bdc5cc7928edac919aea8bcbeea.mp4?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/797e4a239e97d1e1528daa673e0c47cd.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A map shrouded in mist awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the mist away as you advance forward, and discover hidden enemies, facilities, and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could be hiding in the mist? Anticipate anything and account for everything in your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/f56317a12248260b785c9d752ac15505.poster.avif?t=1747629834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/f56317a12248260b785c9d752ac15505.webm?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/f56317a12248260b785c9d752ac15505.mp4?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/7d33e824ea481e6e57bf51d4c13de1c9.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different cards will appear on different stages, allowing you to build a new deck and experience a new combat style on each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/72d961712cdc61f1f0c9a583f380ee75.poster.avif?t=1747629834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/72d961712cdc61f1f0c9a583f380ee75.webm?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/72d961712cdc61f1f0c9a583f380ee75.mp4?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/8d1d67909b427a6cdb6fbb26b0e5ef6d.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Clausewitz Battalion is voiced by the following people:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Captain Vel Dina: Lynn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Swordsman Leon Haith: Takeo Otsuka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Heavy Infantryman Alex Galleon: Hiroki Yasumoto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Archer Lily Maple: Chiwa Saito</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Scout Seth Arden: Atsumi Tanezaki</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Cavalry Erik Lapide: Yuuichirou Umehara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Thief Jade Shadowclaw: Nobuhiko Okamoto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Wizard Ann Clausen: Karin Takahashi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has both Japanese and English voice options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your language and experience the story in either!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/5247737d32107c9928bec4237291d9e1.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the acronym C.A.R.D.S. RPG:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C: Commander - Represents Veldina's leadership</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Adventure - Represents the Clausewitz Mercenary Group</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R: Revolution - Represents innovative games and narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D: Deck building - Represents the genre and gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S: Strategy - Represents the strategic elements of the entire game</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike-style deckbuilding and SRPGs meet in this game to create an all-new genre!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the Clausewitz Battalion into a map shrouded in mist. Find and enhance cards to create powerful decks to do battle with against strong foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/8cffef7973a0539d65ce0e75eb56fbda.poster.avif?t=1747629834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/8cffef7973a0539d65ce0e75eb56fbda.webm?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/8cffef7973a0539d65ce0e75eb56fbda.mp4?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/ad5bbb04a13f4be0ab6cbe715dc501c1.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On that day, a jet black dragon descended on the kingdom, and in the blink of an eye it had destroyed everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 100 Years' War...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That was the name given to the ongoing battle between the 17 countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Already it seemed like a war with no end, but the appearance of a single dragon changed everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was a &quot;chimera&quot; created from a dragon with no interest in the humans' war and the spirit of a warmongering human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The weapon, created by the enemy country Fahftania, could not be completed without great sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Fahftania joined forces with the giant organization Hellmuth Brigade to sacrifice 1000 of their citizens to create the greatest chimera in history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having acquired this overwhelming power, no one possessed the ability to defeat Fahftania and the Hellmuth Brigade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seth Arden, a scout from the Clausewitz Battalion has discovered that Fahftania is creating chimeras in their aim to take over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearing this, Captain Vel Dina is angered by their inhumane experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To put a stop to these terrible, cold-hearted experiments, the Clausewitz Battalion sets off for Fahftania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, they would soon find that all of Fahftania is under the Hellmuth Brigade thrall... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/f74dd0367b31cbfa1421ee94ae0a9a65.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Fresh Gameplay: combining roguelike-style deckbuilding with SRPGs for a brand-new experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Cards: over 100 varieties, all with unique designs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Search Through the Mist: Clear away the mist on the map to discover enemies, facilities, and equipment and form a battle plan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Battle system: combines SRPG turn-based battles with card battles<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/923bf8ca85ea0607ced5b155882f419e.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the unique tactical gameplay offered by SRPGs with a rougelike twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use over 100 varieties of cards to build powerful decks, and strategically confront enemies on an SRPG field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter requires a different strategy. Adapt to new battlegrounds and plan accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the strongest deck and put a stop to the Hellmuth Brigade's actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss out on this new gaming experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/973881cbab504e689852928071532d7b.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It adds the elements of card battles to the traditional SRPG strategy-focused turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good deckbuilding is important to gain the upper edge in any battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fusion of the strategic positioning and tactics of SRPGs, with the excitement of card battlers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/81a86bdc5cc7928edac919aea8bcbeea.poster.avif?t=1747629834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/81a86bdc5cc7928edac919aea8bcbeea.webm?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/81a86bdc5cc7928edac919aea8bcbeea.mp4?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/797e4a239e97d1e1528daa673e0c47cd.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A map shrouded in mist awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the mist away as you advance forward, and discover hidden enemies, facilities, and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could be hiding in the mist? Anticipate anything and account for everything in your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/f56317a12248260b785c9d752ac15505.poster.avif?t=1747629834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/f56317a12248260b785c9d752ac15505.webm?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/f56317a12248260b785c9d752ac15505.mp4?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/7d33e824ea481e6e57bf51d4c13de1c9.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different cards will appear on different stages, allowing you to build a new deck and experience a new combat style on each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/72d961712cdc61f1f0c9a583f380ee75.poster.avif?t=1747629834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/72d961712cdc61f1f0c9a583f380ee75.webm?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/72d961712cdc61f1f0c9a583f380ee75.mp4?t=1747629834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/8d1d67909b427a6cdb6fbb26b0e5ef6d.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Clausewitz Battalion is voiced by the following people:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Captain Vel Dina: Lynn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Swordsman Leon Haith: Takeo Otsuka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Heavy Infantryman Alex Galleon: Hiroki Yasumoto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Archer Lily Maple: Chiwa Saito</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Scout Seth Arden: Atsumi Tanezaki</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Cavalry Erik Lapide: Yuuichirou Umehara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Thief Jade Shadowclaw: Nobuhiko Okamoto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb Wizard Ann Clausen: Karin Takahashi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has both Japanese and English voice options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your language and experience the story in either!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539880/extras/5247737d32107c9928bec4237291d9e1.avif?t=1747629834\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the acronym C.A.R.D.S. RPG:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C: Commander - Represents Veldina's leadership</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Adventure - Represents the Clausewitz Mercenary Group</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R: Revolution - Represents innovative games and narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D: Deck building - Represents the genre and gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S: Strategy - Represents the strategic elements of the entire game</p>",
